# PySQLRDB.py is generated from PySQLRDB.py.in by this directory's Makefile
# and must not be tracked (#9678).  .out1 and .out2 are the scratch files
# that rule writes on the way.  PySQLRDB.py.in and the hand written
# PySQLRClient.py stay tracked
/PySQLRDB.py
/PySQLRDB.py.out1
/PySQLRDB.py.out2

# byte code python writes when the modules are imported
*.pyc
/__pycache__/
